## ✅ Final Configuration

The resulting Kubernetes resources should have:

```text
Deployment:  nginx
Replicas:    1
Container:   nginx
Image:       nginx:latest
Label:       app=nginx
```

This completes the Kubernetes Deployment creation lab using an Nginx container image.

